WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.480
Home, from out there.

00:02.180 --> 00:05.829
From out here the whole Earth is a small, bright ball in the dark.

00:06.279 --> 00:10.734
The flight lasted nine days and ended with a splashdown in the sea.

00:11.184 --> 00:15.316
It was a test of the ship and of the people, for what comes next.
